      ],
      "content": "TRING RURAL            PUTTENHAM SP 81 SE 3/135                                   Statue of Venus on -                                       E side of drive at                                         Grange Farm GV                                      II Statue. '1741', 'JAN VAN LOGTTAREN' inscribed on base at side and rear. Brought from The Green Park, Aston Clinton c.1948.  Carved stone. A larger than lifesize standing figure of Venus with drapery standing before a large scallop shell with a winged child (now headless). Moulded bluestone plinth with concave corners. One of a matched pair with statue of Adonis (q.v.) and one contemporary plinth is nearby (q.v.) Listing NGR: SP8857814712"
    }
